        "notes": "Quantum Threshold is a first-person shooter set in a dystopian, cyberpunk-themed future where players combat rogue AI entities. The game features frequent, stylized sci-fi violence using guns, explosives, and deployable weapons such as turrets and drones. Enemies are robotic or synthetic in nature \u2014 there is no blood, gore, or graphic dismemberment.\r\n\r\nThere is no sexual content, nudity, or suggestive themes in the game.\r\n\r\nThe game also contains no references to drug use,  tobacco, self-harm, or suicide, and does not depict any form of sexual violence, non-consensual acts, or fetish-related content such as BDSM."
